# User Docs SoT

**Roles:** `cli-reference` (flags + exit codes SoT) · `recipes` (cookbooks) · `methodology` (NCLOC/indent) · `warning-codes` (catalog).

Ownership: [DOC-OWNERSHIP.md](../../.specs/codebase/DOC-OWNERSHIP.md). Lint: `lintDocsUserDoc`.

## Forbidden

- `\bM\d+\b`, changelog / provenance voice

## Allowed

- Present-tense encyclopedias/cookbooks; exit-code table in cli-reference; links to README / ARCHITECTURE / CONTRIBUTING

## Sync

Power-user flags → cli-reference; first-run essentials → README + one cli-reference entry; workflows → recipes; codes → warning-codes.
